# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command dump
usage 1   dump <space> <addr> <len> <file> write raw bytes to home/Logs/<CoreName>/<file>

case bytes to a file
target fake
covers 1
$ dump
out 39
Usage: dump <space> <addr> <len> <file>
status 0
action none
$ dump RAM 0 8 ram.bin
out 58
Dumped RAM 0x0-0x7 (8 bytes) to <ROOT>/Logs/GOLDEN/ram.bin
status 0
action none
$ xxd Logs/GOLDEN/ram.bin
out 67
  000000: 03 0A 11 18 1F 26 2D 34                          .....&-4
status 0
action none
$ dump IO 0 4 io.bin
out 143
IO can have real side effects on read (live hardware registers) - refusing a bulk dump there. Try WRAM (or another plain-memory space) instead.
status 0
action none
$ dump NOPE 0 1 x.bin
out 83
Error: No memory space named 'NOPE'. Available: RAM, ROM, VRAM, IO, UNSIZED, CpuBus
status 1
action none
$ dump RAM F8 10 over.bin
out 63
Dumped RAM 0xF8-0x107 (16 bytes) to <ROOT>/Logs/GOLDEN/over.bin
status 0
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
0
status 0
action none
$ dump RAM 0 4 ../../up.bin
out 63
Dumped RAM 0x0-0x3 (4 bytes) to <ROOT>/Logs/GOLDEN/../../up.bin
status 0
action none
$ ls
out 54
Cheats/
Firmware/
Games/
Logs/
Saves/
etc/
tmp/
up.bin
status 0
action none
$ dump RAM 0 0 empty.bin
out 67
Dumped RAM 0x0-0xFFFFFFFF (0 bytes) to <ROOT>/Logs/GOLDEN/empty.bin
status 0
action none
end

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ dump RAM 0 1 x.bin
out 65
Error: No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
end

case a file name that climbs out of the root
target fake
covers 1
$ dump RAM 0 4 ../../../escaped.bin
out 71
Dumped RAM 0x0-0x3 (4 bytes) to <ROOT>/Logs/GOLDEN/../../../escaped.bin
status 0
action none
$ ls /..
out 49
ls: '/..' is outside the project sandbox (<ROOT>)
status 1
action none
$ load RAM 0 ../../../escaped.bin
out 85
Loaded 4 bytes from <ROOT>/Logs/GOLDEN/../../../escaped.bin into RAM starting at 0x0.
status 0
action none
end
